1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,870
Episode 26: Open Door, Closed Heart

2
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:08,934
Word of the grand cathedral's
liberation spread like

3
00:00:09,034 --> 00:00:11,840
wildfire across the imperial
capital of Lighthaven.

4
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:14,673
Merchants and dockworkers who had endured decades under
tyranny poured into the avenues bearing blazing pine torches.

5
00:00:14,773 --> 00:00:17,810
And amidst the roaring acclamation of the populace, the Sun Gate—the
first perimeter portal of the inner citadel—was forced wide open.

6
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:20,222
Yet beyond the shattered iron gates,

7
00:00:20,322 --> 00:00:23,780
the inner palaces presented
an uncanny, necrotic gloom.

8
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:26,658
Fountains in the grand plaza pooled with foul,
bubbling sulfur wastewater instead of clear springs,

9
00:00:26,758 --> 00:00:29,750
and from every marble colonnade, flocks of ominous black
ravens tainted by the Nine Shadows Codex took flight.

10
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:33,178
Though the physical gates had fallen, the
hardened hearts of the imperial aristocracy,

11
00:00:33,278 --> 00:00:35,720
steeped in terror and tyranny,
remained sealed behind stone walls.

12
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:41,690
Bracing his Dragon Breaker shield, Kadan
surveyed the parapets with sharp eyes.

13
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:47,660
[Kadan] "The iron gate has fallen,
but the battle is far from won.

14
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:50,644
[Celia] Lucian has entrenched
himself within the Obsidian

15
00:00:50,744 --> 00:00:53,630
Spire of the inner keep,
preparing a fanatical last stand."

16
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:56,665
[Ignis] Lifting her Jade
Staff, Cilia inhaled the

17
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:59,600
chilly night air, her brow
furrowing in distaste.

18
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:05,570
[Kadan] "Scarcely any living mortal
aura lingers within these walls.

19
00:01:05,770 --> 00:01:09,110
The courtiers and shock guards have been
poisoned by Medusa Gorgo's necrotic venom,

20
00:01:09,210 --> 00:01:11,540
reduced to mindless marionettes
devoid of human sentiment."

21
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:14,448
Gazing upon the scorched
guard barracks where

22
00:01:14,548 --> 00:01:17,510
he had once trained, Ignis
spoke in solemn grief.

23
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:23,480
"The palace gardens where I played as a
boy have rotted into a festering pit...

24
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:26,579
[Celia] It tears at my
heart that I must shatter

25
00:01:26,679 --> 00:01:29,450
the memories of my youth
to deliver judgment."

26
00:01:29,650 --> 00:01:35,420
Kadan placed a firm hand
upon Ignis's shoulder.

27
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:41,390
"New flesh can never bloom until the
necrotic gangrene is carved away.

28
00:01:41,590 --> 00:01:47,360
[Balthazar] Forward, Ignis."

29
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:50,204
Advancing into the central courtyard,
a gilded balcony door creaked open,

30
00:01:50,304 --> 00:01:53,330
revealing Count Balthazar, commander of
the inner palace guard and Lucian's cousin.

31
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:57,136
Black serpentine runes coiled
around Balthazar's throat,

32
00:01:57,236 --> 00:01:59,300
and his eyes burned with madness.

33
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:02,897
[Ignis] Clutching the railing,
Balthazar laughed maniacally.

34
00:02:02,997 --> 00:02:05,270
"Insolent commoners and turncoat knights!

35
00:02:05,470 --> 00:02:08,305
[Balthazar] How dare you set
foot in the imperial gardens!

36
00:02:08,405 --> 00:02:11,240
Tonight, your severed heads
shall fertilize my rose beds!"

37
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,715
With a snap of his fingers,
the marble flags parted,

38
00:02:13,815 --> 00:02:17,210
unleashing three armored Chimeras
engineered through Gorgo's forbidden arts.

39
00:02:17,410 --> 00:02:19,897
With lion torsos, viper
tails, and black-iron scales,

40
00:02:19,997 --> 00:02:23,180
the roaring monstrosities charged
forward, spitting corrosive acid.

41
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:29,150
[Ignis] Wielding his iron weapon, Ignis
stepped forward. "Count Balthazar!

42
00:02:29,350 --> 00:02:32,324
You, who taught me
swordsmanship in my youth,

43
00:02:32,424 --> 00:02:35,120
have fallen into this abominable madness!

44
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:41,090
Cast down your steel and defile
the empire's honor no longer!"

45
00:02:41,290 --> 00:02:47,060
Balthazar sneered in contempt.

46
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:53,030
"Honor is merely the
excuse of the vanquished!

47
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:59,000
[Ignis] Power alone is the
absolute law of this realm!"

48
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:01,937
The chimeras lunged, their iron-plated claws

49
00:03:02,037 --> 00:03:04,970
cleaving through the air
with concussive snaps.

50
00:03:05,170 --> 00:03:08,108
Without hesitation,
Kadan anchored his Dragon

51
00:03:08,208 --> 00:03:10,940
Breaker shield, unleashing star-breathing.

52
00:03:11,140 --> 00:03:16,910
Boom!

53
00:03:17,110 --> 00:03:19,896
The beast's massive claws slammed
into the dragonbone plate,

54
00:03:19,996 --> 00:03:22,880
only to be pulverized by the
shield's golden kinetic backlash.

55
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:26,729
Twisting his guard upward, Kadan
struck the lead chimera's jaw,

56
00:03:26,829 --> 00:03:28,850
sending the titan tumbling backward.

57
00:03:29,050 --> 00:03:31,673
Vaulting from Kadan's flank,
Ignis cleaved through the air.

58
00:03:31,773 --> 00:03:34,820
"Holy flame of purification, grant
peace to these corrupted beasts!"

59
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:37,765
A crescent of pure white fire
severed the necks of the chimeras,

60
00:03:37,865 --> 00:03:40,790
vaporizing the necrotic corruption
into plumes of clean white steam.

61
00:03:40,990 --> 00:03:43,846
[Ignis] Simultaneously, Cilia swept
her Jade Staff, conjuring a violent

62
00:03:43,946 --> 00:03:46,760
whirlwind that collapsed the marble
balcony beneath Balthazar's boots.

63
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,769
[Balthazar] Crashing onto the flagstones, Balthazar lay
mortally wounded, coughing black blood. Kneeling beside his

64
00:03:49,869 --> 00:03:52,730
former mentor, Ignis spoke through clenched teeth. "Why...
Why did you surrender your soul to Lucian's deceit, Count?

65
00:03:52,930 --> 00:03:58,700
[Balthazar] Did you not teach me that a
true knight is a shield for the weak?"

66
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:04,670
Trembling, Balthazar
gasped in ragged breaths.

67
00:04:04,870 --> 00:04:10,640
[Celia] "Ignis...

68
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:16,610
[Kadan] Minister Lucian
is no mere conspirator...

69
00:04:16,810 --> 00:04:19,369
Behind him stands the true
archduke of the abyss,

70
00:04:19,469 --> 00:04:22,580
Belphegor... Tomorrow at
midnight... In the Jade Council...

71
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:26,135
[Celia] The emperor's soul will be offered as
a blood sacrifice..." With those final words,

72
00:04:26,235 --> 00:04:28,550
Balthazar expired, the serpent
runes dissolving into thin smoke.

73
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:31,756
[Kadan] Cilia closed the fallen nobleman's
eyes with a gentle wind prayer.

74
00:04:31,856 --> 00:04:34,520
"The tragedy of those whose fear
locked their hearts in darkness."

75
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:40,490
Tightening his grip on his shield,
Kadan spoke with unwavering resolve.

76
00:04:40,690 --> 00:04:43,547
"Tomorrow at midnight, the council
will attempt the dark coronation.

77
00:04:43,647 --> 00:04:46,460
We must seize the barrier tower
before the blood sacrifice begins."

78
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:49,495
With the courtyard secured,
volunteer militias from the

79
00:04:49,595 --> 00:04:52,430
cathedral took up defensive
perches along the parapets.

80
00:04:52,630 --> 00:04:58,400
Rondol and Grimli arrived with fresh
supplies, fortifying the forward breach.

81
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,390
[Ignis] Gathered around a small
brazier beneath the shadow of the

82
00:05:01,490 --> 00:05:04,370
Obsidian Spire, the three companions
studied the palace blueprints.

83
00:05:04,570 --> 00:05:06,724
[Kadan] Touching the scars across his palms,

84
00:05:06,824 --> 00:05:10,340
Ignis whispered into the night.
"Tomorrow night, everything concludes.

85
00:05:10,540 --> 00:05:12,513
Even if my life is extinguished,

86
00:05:12,613 --> 00:05:16,310
I will deliver the emperor and
our people from the abyss."

87
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:22,280
Touching the crimson knot of his
silver dagger, Kadan replied.

88
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:25,699
[Kadan] "We shall live through the storm
together, Ignis. When the dawn breaks,

89
00:05:25,799 --> 00:05:28,250
we will look upon a realm where
children smile without fear."

90
00:05:28,450 --> 00:05:30,810
Clasping hands in an unbreakable vow,

91
00:05:30,910 --> 00:05:34,220
the three youths stood
ready for the fateful night.

92
